# Frontend environment template.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle, and the
# value is inlined at build time - so change it and rebuild (or redeploy) for it
# to take effect. Copy this file to `frontend/.env.local` for local overrides;
# `frontend/.env*` is git-ignored.
#
# Local development (default when the file is absent):
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Deployed value: set this to the real Render API URL in the Vercel project settings.
